        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate from our headquarters and main banking office in Chicago, Illinois, and we have five additional full-service branch offices in Illinois located in Chicago, Oak Lawn, Wheeling and Worth.",
