        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We consider our balance sheet as well as market conditions on an ongoing basis in making decisions as to whether to hold loans we originate for investment or to sell such loans choosing the strategy that is most advantageous to us from a profitability and risk management standpoint.",
        "start_character": 13499,
        "end_character": 13782
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035156",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035156-d41c639151a9fb79",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035156",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have established policies, procedures and systems designed to comply with the Sarbanes-Oxley Act of 2002 and its implementing regulations, and we review and document such policies, procedures and systems to ensure continued compliance.",
        "start_character": 97089,
        "end_character": 97327
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035156",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035156-d41c639151a9fb79",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035156",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We offer regular lines of credit and revolving lines of credit to small businesses in our market area to finance short-term working capital needs such as accounts receivable and inventory with terms generally up to twelve months and that are due on demand and subject to annual automatic renewal or a renewal process.",
        "start_character": 23814,
        "end_character": 24131
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035156",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035156-d41c639151a9fb79",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035156",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We use traditional means of advertising deposit products, including broadcast and print media and we generally do not solicit deposits from outside our market area.",
        "start_character": 56219,
        "end_character": 56383
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035156",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035156-d41c639151a9fb79",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035156",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "In addition to maintaining credit standards for new originations which we believe are sound, we are proactive in our loan monitoring, collection and workout processes in dealing with delinquent or problem loans.",
        "start_character": 27492,
        "end_character": 27703
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035156",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035156-d41c639151a9fb79",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035156",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Our historical principal lending activity has been the origination of loans collateralized by one to four residential real estate loans located in our market area but we are focusing on increasing our origination of commercial real estate (including commercial construction) and commercial and industrial loans and, to a lesser extent, home equity loans and consumer loans, and other collateral and unsecured personal loans.",
        "start_character": 7114,
        "end_character": 7538
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035156",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035156-d41c639151a9fb79",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035156",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are subject to comprehensive regulation and examination by the Illinois Department of Financial & Professional Regulation (“IDFPR”) and the Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (“FDIC”).",
        "start_character": 3997,
        "end_character": 4187
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035156",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035156-d41c639151a9fb79",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035156",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We face additional competition for deposits from short-term money market funds and other corporate and government securities funds, mutual funds and from other non-depository financial institutions such as brokerage firms and insurance companies.",
